<mxfile host="65bd71144e">
    <diagram id="page1" name="Protocol Requirements + Overview">
        <mxGraphModel dx="1351" dy="868" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="850" pageHeight="1100" math="0" shadow="0">
            <root>
                <mxCell id="0"/>
                <mxCell id="1" parent="0"/>
                <mxCell id="title1" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" value="Protocol Requirements" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="30" width="300" x="275" y="20" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="reqbox" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" value="&lt;b&gt;Protocol Requirements&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. The protocol shall allow a user to register a unique agent name in the format protocol://agentid.capability.provider.vVERSION&lt;br&gt;2. The protocol shall store one on-chain record per name, addressed by the SHA-256 hash of the full name&lt;br&gt;3. The protocol shall allow the owner to update the endpoint, transfer the name, or revoke it&lt;br&gt;4. The protocol shall keep a revoked name reserved so nobody else can impersonate it&lt;br&gt;5. The protocol shall require a minimum stake (SOL) to register, held inside the agent record&lt;br&gt;6. The protocol shall charge a registration fee, sent to the treasury&lt;br&gt;7. The protocol shall allow admin-approved verifiers to report challenge results (pass or fail)&lt;br&gt;8. The protocol shall slash a share of the stake (default 10%) to the treasury when a challenge fails&lt;br&gt;9. The protocol shall allow unstaking only after a cooldown, and keep a revoked name slashable during the cooldown&lt;br&gt;10. The protocol shall mark an endpoint as verified only after the agent proves it controls its key&lt;br&gt;11. The protocol shall allow an owner to list a name at a fixed price and anyone to buy it in one transaction&lt;br&gt;12. The protocol shall charge a sale fee (at most 10%), sent to the treasury; stake and reputation move with the name&lt;br&gt;13. The protocol shall serve name lookups through a resolver that signs every answer, with the signing key stored on-chain&lt;br&gt;14. The protocol shall index all on-chain events and show every agent&#39;s history in a public Explorer" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="280" width="750" x="50" y="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="title1b" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=20;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" value="Overview" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="30" width="150" x="350" y="350" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="progbox" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;strokeWidth=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;AgentNS Program&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;+ owner: Pubkey&lt;br&gt;+ name: String&lt;br&gt;+ endpoint: String&lt;br&gt;+ agent_pubkey: Pubkey&lt;br&gt;+ status: Active | Revoked&lt;br&gt;+ stake_lamports: u64&lt;br&gt;+ passes: u32&lt;br&gt;+ fails: u32&lt;br&gt;+ unstake_requested_at: i64&lt;br&gt;+ endpoint_verified: bool" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="200" width="350" x="250" y="400" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="owner1" parent="1" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" value="Owner" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="60" width="30" x="680" y="420" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="verifier1" parent="1" style="shape=umlActor;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;html=1;outlineConnect=0;fontSize=11;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" value="Verifier" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="60" width="30" x="680" y="520" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="treasury1" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;strokeWidth=2;" value="Treasury" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="40" width="150" x="350" y="650" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="arr1" edge="1" parent="1" source="owner1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.3;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#00AA00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" target="progbox" value="1 - Registers name + stake">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="arr2" edge="1" parent="1" source="progbox" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#00AA00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" target="treasury1" value="2 - Fee sent to treasury">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="arr3" edge="1" parent="1" source="verifier1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.7;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#0000CC;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" target="progbox" value="3 - Reports challenge">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="arr4" edge="1" parent="1" source="progbox" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#0000CC;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" target="treasury1" value="4 - Failed challenge slashes stake">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="arr5" edge="1" parent="1" source="owner1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0;exitY=0.8;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#8B0000;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" target="progbox" value="5 - Requests unstake">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="arr6" edge="1" parent="1" source="progbox" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#8B0000;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=10;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" target="owner1" value="6 - Stake returned after cooldown">
                    <mxGeometry relative="1" x="-0.0067" y="-10" as="geometry">
                        <mxPoint as="offset"/>
                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="stepsbox" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" value="&lt;b&gt;Steps&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 - Owner registers a name: the program checks the name rules and hash; the record is created and the stake is held inside it&lt;br&gt;2 - Fee goes to the treasury&lt;br&gt;3 - Verifier tests the agent endpoint and reports pass or fail on-chain&lt;br&gt;4 - On a fail the program takes 10% of the stake and clears the endpoint-verified flag&lt;br&gt;5 - Owner requests unstake; revoking a name does this automatically&lt;br&gt;6 - After the cooldown the owner withdraws the remaining stake" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="120" width="750" x="50" y="720" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
        </mxGraphModel>
    </diagram>
