                <mxCell id="steps10" parent="1" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;fontFamily=IBM Plex Sans;" value="&lt;b&gt;End to end&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 - Owner registers a name and the stake is locked in the agent record&lt;br&gt;2 - The program emits events; the Indexer stores history and badges&lt;br&gt;3 - An agent or app asks the Resolver for a name and gets a signed answer&lt;br&gt;4 - A Verifier tests the agent endpoint and reports on-chain&lt;br&gt;5 - The Explorer shows the agent page: owner, stake, history, badge, health&lt;br&gt;6 - A Buyer can buy listed names; fees go to the treasury" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry height="120" width="1000" x="50" y="60" as="geometry"/>
